-   */
-
-  /*
-    4.4.4 RTCIceConnectionState Enum
-      new
-        Any of the RTCIceTransports are in the new state and none of them
-        are in the checking, failed or disconnected state, or all
-        RTCIceTransport s are in the closed state.
-   */
-  test(t => {
